# [fufu] FORK-OWNED patched LibActionButton-1.0 — loaded OUTSIDE the
# #@no-lib-strip@ block on purpose. It is committed fork source (no .pkgmeta
# external), so it must ship AND load in BOTH the normal and the no-lib
# packaged builds. Inside the strip block, a no-lib build drops this line and
# silently runs stock/absent LibActionButton, losing every perf patch. Do NOT
# move it back inside the strip markers. (Loads after LibButtonGlow above in
# the normal build; same always-load treatment as SimpleSticky/LibDataBroker.)
libs\LibActionButton-1.0\LibActionButton-1.0.lua

libs\SimpleSticky.lua

locale\locale.xml

